{"lyrics":"[00:12.54]Yep-yep-yep, uh\n[00:14.22]I'm Jack with a bean (Uh), all my diamonds gleam (Uh)\n[00:17.84]Everything that I do, I do for my team (Gang)\n[00:21.26]Walkin' 'round with a Glock and it got a beam (Uh)\n[00:24.76]Hunnid thousand dollars stuffed inside a nigga jeans (Uh)\n[00:28.24]Bitch I'm rich, bitch I'm rich, been rich since a teen (Ooh)\n[00:31.74]Bitch I'm rich, bitch I'm rich, been rich since a teen (Yep-yep-yep)\n[00:35.20]I'm that nigga all these new niggas wanna be (Uh)\n[00:38.48]And I won't stop 'til I'm dead at a murder scene (Let's go)\n[00:42.58]They can't kill me, I'm invicible, uh (Bitch, I won't die)\n[00:46.08]Fuck my school and fuck my principal, uh (They can all die)\n[00:49.88]I ain't ever get to principles (No)\n[00:52.38]But thanks to Travis I still got the antidote, yeah (Right)\n[00:55.70]I'm gon' crash the rental (Skrrt), codeine in my Minute Maid (Lean)\n[00:59.38]Diamonds on my dental (Yeah), bitch I feel like Flava Flav (Lean)\n[01:02.74]I don't use a pencil (Yeah), this shit comin' off the brain (Lean)\n[01:06.20]Bitch I need your mental (Yeah), bitch I need that super brain\n[01:09.52]Tell me what you into (Yeah), hit me wit' your info (Yeah)\n[01:13.18]I'ma fuck you, leave, maybe leave a voice memo (Hey, hey, yeah)\n[01:16.68]I may drop your name on my favorite instrumental (Hey, hey, ya' dig?)\n[01:20.10]I may blow you up like a pop with some Mentos (Hey, hey, yeah)\n[01:23.22]Yep-yep-yep, uh\n[01:23.78]I'm Jack with a bean (Uh), all my diamonds gleam (Uh)\n[01:27.40]Everything that I do, I do for my team (Gang)\n[01:30.84]Walkin' 'round with a Glock and it got a beam (Uh)\n[01:34.34]Hunnid thousand dollars stuffed inside a nigga jeans (Uh)\n[01:37.80]Bitch I'm rich, bitch I'm rich, been rich since a teen (Ooh)\n[01:41.30]Bitch I'm rich, bitch I'm rich, been rich since a teen (Yep-yep-yep)\n[01:44.88]I'm that nigga all these new niggas wanna be (Uh)\n[01:48.08]And I won't stop 'til I'm dead at a murder scene (Let's